","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Bars","historical_business_count":5}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), American (Traditional), Bars, Breakfast & Brunch, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":7},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"3wo9jODQnuvBm8Gkem6qXg","review_id":"0kHa2Nbg1rUzdK93d0o1fg","date":"2016-09-30T21:01:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9408815503120422,"text_excerpt":"Great location for a hearty breakfast/lunch/brunch that's off the beaten path and easy on the pocketbook. D (can't remember her full name) was a gem- great personality and very friendly especially for it being so early. She even remembered that she had waited on my dining partners in the past. The only thing that blows would be that the space is small and can be tricky if you're coming with a large group. We planned to arrive super early on Sunday so that we could get a table before the lines formed. We had a group of 4 plus a child so they were able to work with us but , just a forewarning, they don't seat until the entire party is there. Fair enough. I ordered the iced coffee to start (..."},{"business_id":"3wo9jODQnuvBm8Gkem6qXg","review_id":"HBOw_wlTmAKcXUvsbaMLqw","date":"2018-06-24T16:57:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9402543306350708,"text_excerpt":"Had brunch at the bar this morning and it was absolutely perfect. The bartender/server, Jack, is always so funny and pleasant and attentive. The mimosas are heavy on the bubbly and Ruby Slipper's coffee is my favorite of all the diner-type restaurants in the city. I had pancakes with eggs and bacon--simple but perfectly executed. My friend had the Eggs Blackstone, which is a favorite of mine. We had a lovely meal and felt welcomed and taken care of. This place is a gem."},{"business_id":"3wo9jODQnuvBm8Gkem6qXg","review_id":"0Oni5hCMQg6ywQij9-x1dQ","date":"2016-11-06T21:24:26","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.939429759979248,"text_excerpt":"The food here is phenomenal! We had the bananas foster french toast, st Charles chicken, eggs cochon, and shrimp Cortez. The eggs Benedict was good but it could have had a little more hollandaise or some other complementary sauce. The shrimp Cortez was surprisingly delicious even though it didn't look like much. They had me at jalapeños. Ou waitress was initially distant but she made up for it with great overall service. The place is small and cute and the wait is long. I recommend getting in the wait list thru yelp an hour before you go there."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3wo9jODQnuvBm8Gkem6qXg","photo_id":"xUCDYumSVs7--qYvvoZ-1A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/xUCDYumSVs7--qYvvoZ-1A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8409034013748169},{"business_id":"3wo9jODQnuvBm8Gkem6qXg","photo_id":"Kmzzl5DJgv-KsQT21QXPFQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Kmzzl5DJgv-KsQT21QXPFQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8401000499725342},{"business_id":"3wo9jODQnuvBm8Gkem6qXg","photo_id":"foHXmLKq6gyy4_NwAbcNIQ","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/foHXmLKq6gyy4_NwAbcNIQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8203302025794983},{"business_id":"3wo9jODQnuvBm8Gkem6qXg","photo_id":"pqIl70AUDm9EGORM0m0auA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/pqIl70AUDm9EGORM0m0auA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.811144232749939},{"business_id":"3wo9jODQnuvBm8Gkem6qXg","photo_id":"tBHDPsGdhQl6dCNqp9GnAA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/tBHDPsGdhQl6dCNqp9GnAA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8076072931289673}]},"notebook_case":null}
